elled and extinguished.","**Network18 Media & Investments** -- NCLT Mumbai sanctions the Scheme of Amalgamation of wholly owned subsidiary News18 Marathi into the Company, effective once all conditions precedent are fulfilled.","**Aeroflex Enterprises** -- subsidiary Aeroflex Neu completes acquisition of a 51.01% stake in Stilonn Valves and Controls, entering the AI-infra/data-centre critical-engineering space; value not disclosed.","**Charms Industries** -- executes an SPA for a 24.37% change-of-control stake, triggering a mandatory SEBI SAST open offer, alongside a proposed preferential issue of equity and warrants aggregating up to Rs 30 cr (our arithmetic: Rs 4.9 cr + Rs 25.1 cr); all subject to shareholder/regulatory approval.","**JTL Defence** -- board-meeting outcome is the Q2 FY27 financial results, not an acquisition (baseline's own content-mismatch flag retained)."],"capex_core":["**Bharat Petroleum** -- incorporates a wholly owned project SPV for its proposed Greenfield Refinery and Petrochemical Complex at Ramayapatnam, Andhra Pradesh, with an initial AUTHORISED capital ceiling of Rs 4,900 cr; the financial investment decision itself is still pending detailed feasibility work."],"business_updates":["**Results season** -- 12 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) -- tracked in the Results tab, per the baseline's own count, not itemised here.","**Shakti Pumps (India)** -- H1 FY27 revenue up 24.5% YoY to Rs 1,604.7 cr; Q2 FY27 revenue up 12% YoY to Rs 746 cr."],"distress_risk":["**Indian Railway Finance Corporation** -- the GST Authority (Delhi) passes a Nil-demand order on 23-Oct, dropping an earlier Rs 549.32 cr show-cause notice against the Company.","**Tata Chemicals** -- the High Court of Kenya rules it has no jurisdiction over the Ministry of Mining's notice to Tata Chemicals Magadi (its Kenyan subsidiary); TCML is reviewing the order and next legal steps.","**DIC India** -- update on a transfer-pricing adjustment matter (filing is a scanned image, not machine-readable this pass; carried from the baseline's own line, per Sec 7b).","**Reliance Communications** -- NCLT Mumbai allows the Resolution Professional's application directing the ROC to process RCOM's AGM-extension filings on the MCA portal despite its 'Under CIRP' status (baseline had mis-tagged this an order win).","**Quadrant Televentures** -- 17th Committee of Creditors meeting ratifies (95.6% vote) the appointment of legal counsel for the Resolution Professional, under ongoing CIRP.","**Kobo Biotech** -- NCLT Hyderabad appoints Rajat Mukherjee as Chairman of the Monitoring Committee, replacing the resigned Resolution Professional, under ongoing insolvency proceedings.","**Zicom Electronic Security Systems** -- files its Monitoring Committee constitution report with NCLT Mumbai under ongoing CIRP."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Wheels India** -- ICRA upgrades ratings across fixed deposits, term loans and fund/non-fund-based facilities to A+(Stable)/A1 from A(Stable)/A2+.","**IDBI Bank** -- CRISIL places long-term debt instruments on 'Watch Positive' (CP reaffirmed A1+), following the already-disclosed (14-Oct) CCEA approval of Fairfax's ~Rs 52,878 cr purchase of a 60.72% stake; no new content beyond that approval."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/c9e7de81-66de-4937-8588-118b12d6166c.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BLKASHYAP_24102026123628_BLK_LOA.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.